      "description": "The term 'cisgender' refers to individuals whose gender identity aligns with the sex they were assigned at birth. In the meme, 'cis girls' is used to label the woman holding the baby, implying a contrast with the self-identified person ('me'), who may identify as transgender or non-binary. This requires understanding of gender identity terminology and the social construct of gender.",
